        <title>Impactful scheduling for GPU clusters</title>
        <link>https://allenai.org/blog/impactful-scheduling</link>
        <pubDate>2026-10-09T00:00:00-08:00</pubDate>
        <description>
          <![CDATA[
            <div style="display: flex; gap: 12px">
              <div>We explain how Ai2’s new GPU scheduler uses time budgets, fair-share allocation, and time-slicing to prioritize high-impact research, shorten queue waits, and keep GPUs busy.</div>
              <img src="https://www.datocms-assets.com/64837/1791481523-impactful-scheduling-for-gpu-clusters-google-docs-image-1-1.png?w=200" width="200" alt="Impactful scheduling for GPU clusters" />
            </div>
          ]]>
        </description>
